id: EVT13-3
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: projection_derive
target: crates/core/src/projection.rs
find:                     Cause::Input => self.merge_change(&at.step, path, before, after),
replace:                     _ if true => self.merge_change(&at.step, path, before, after),
expect-fail: evt13_non_input_changes_are_not_marked_or_reviewed
expect-fail: p1c_p1d_without_restore
expect-fail: p1c_p1d_with_save_restore
note: 変化の原因が Input かの絞り込みを外す（停止・移動・復帰・開始の巻き戻しも印・復習に入る）
